OL,3,ANew policies, election speculation:
OL,4,AWhat to expect from Burnham's first
OL,5,ALabour conference as PM
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham had plenty to say about
OL,8,Fwhere the government - and the country
OL,9,F- was going wrong at last year's Labour
OL,10,Fconference in Liverpool.
OL,12,FBut that was at a fringe meeting on the
OL,13,Fsidelines of the main event.
OL,15,FNow, as Labour leader and prime
OL,16,Fminister, he is the main event - and it
OL,17,Fis down to him to show party members
OL,18,Fand the wider public that he has some
OL,19,Fanswers.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
