OL,3,ANew policies, election speculation:
OL,4,AWhat to expect from Burnham's first
OL,5,ALabour conference as PM
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier this week, he said his debut
OL,8,Fleader's speech would leave nobody in
OL,9,Fany doubt about "what I'm trying to do
OL,10,Fin this role".
